  "id": "executive-functions",
  "term": "executive functions",
  "definition": "Executive functions are higher-level mental control processes that support goal-directed behavior, self-regulation, and adapting to changing situations across life. They are commonly understood to include inhibitory control, updating information in working memory, and cognitive flexibility.",
